            <ArticleTitle>Sexual dysfunction caused by reboxetine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>77-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author reports on self-experienced, reboxetine-induced sexual dysfunction (prolonged orgasm of reduced intensity) and seminal emission after defecation. Both disorders were accompanied by pain and ceased within two days after discontinuation of the drug.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
